usage: rebis.ch3mpiler [-h] [--file FILE] [--stdin] COMMAND ...

rebis.ch3mpiler — Molecular Compiler & Retrosynthesis

positional arguments:
  COMMAND               Sub-command (run with COMMAND --help for details)
    forward             Forward synthesis from SMILES
    retrosynth          Retrosynthetic analysis from SMILES
    fg                  Detect functional groups in SMILES
    cdxml               Convert SMILES to CDXML format
    analyze             Full molecular analysis (forward + retrosynth + FG)
    list                List all exported symbols
    info                Show available tools (alias for list)
    help                Show this help message

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --file FILE, -f FILE  Input file (JSON or FASTA/sequence)
  --stdin, -i           Read JSON arguments from stdin
